# DESK14 run C -- the "file not found" path.  The card has no NEWDESK.INF at
# all, so the selector comes up with the pre-filled selection NEWDESK.INF
# (app_read_inf's INF_FILE_NAME+3, deskapp.c:1503) and an empty file list.
# Clicking OK hands that name to Fopen -> EFILNF -> STFILENF with the name
# merged in (deskapp.c:1536-1538).
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 196 8
2200 mark B_OPTIONS
2500 move 200 187
2700 down
2703 up
2900 move 600 240
4000 mark C_FSEL
4300 move 220 401
4500 down
4503 up
4700 move 600 240
5600 mark D_ALERT_NOTFOUND
5900 key 1c
5950 key 9c
6700 mark E_DISMISSED
